SDL 2.32.x: lg4ff HIDAPI driver for the Logitech G29 / G923 (PlayStation/PC), reduced port of
SDL3's driver. The wheel appears as a game controller (steering = left X, throttle/brake =
triggers, paddles = right stick up/down) with rumble as wheel vibration. Env overrides:
SDL_HIDAPI_LG4FF_RANGE, _AUTOCENTER, _RUMBLE, _STEER_COMP, _NO_MODE_SWITCH.
Apply with: git apply sdl2-lg4ff-hidapi-driver.diff
Base: release-2.32.10 (5d24957). Not an SDL submission.

